<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f6fb">
    <title>Yönetim Paneli</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --background: #f4f6fb;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --text: #192238;
            --muted: #788198;
            --primary: #5458d8;
            --primary-light: #eeefff;
            --border: #e8ebf3;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--background);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .layout {
            display: grid;
            min-height: 100vh;
            grid-template-columns: 250px minmax(0, 1fr);
        }

        .sidebar {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 36px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 0 8px;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 750;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            display: grid;
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .nav-label {
            margin: 0 10px 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-list {
            display: grid;
            gap: 6px;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #606a80;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover,
        .nav-link[aria-current="page"] {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .nav-icon {
            width: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        main {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 42px clamp(22px, 5vw, 64px);
        }

        .topbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 34px);
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .admin-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 9px 13px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--surface);
            color: #485168;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .avatar {
            display: grid;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .welcome {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .welcome h2 {
            margin: 0 0 9px;
            font-size: 21px;
        }

        .welcome p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .section-heading {
            display: flex;
            align-items: end;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 36px 0 16px;
        }

        .section-heading h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .section-heading p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .card {
            display: flex;
            min-height: 190px;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 23px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: var(--surface);
            transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: #d7d9ff;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgb(34 42 74 / 8%);
        }

        .card-icon {
            display: grid;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 13px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            font-size: 21px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 7px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .card-action {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-top: 20px;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 42px;
            padding-top: 18px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .sidebar {
                gap: 22px;
                padding: 18px;
                border-right: 0;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            }

            .sidebar nav {
                overflow-x: auto;
            }

            .nav-label {
                display: none;
            }

            .nav-list {
                display: flex;
                min-width: max-content;
            }

            .nav-link {
                padding: 10px;
            }

            main {
                padding-top: 28px;
            }

            .topbar {
                align-items: flex-start;
                margin-bottom: 34px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .admin-badge {
                padding: 7px;
            }

            .admin-badge span:last-child {
                display: none;
            }

            .section-heading {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="layout">
        <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Yönetim menüsü">
            <a class="brand" href="/admin" aria-label="Yönetim paneli ana sayfası">
                <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">Y</span>
                <span>Yönetim Paneli</span>
            </a>

            <nav aria-label="Ana menü">
                <p class="nav-label">Menü</p>
                <ul class="nav-list">
                    <li>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/admin" aria-current="page">
                            <span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>
                            Genel Bakış
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/admin/listuser">
                            <span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">♙</span>
                            Kullanıcılar
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/admin/getlog">
                            <span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span>
                            İstek Kayıtları
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/admin/adduser">
                            <span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
                            Kullanıcı Ekle
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </aside>

        <main>
            <header class="topbar">
                <div>
                    <p class="breadcrumb">Yönetim / Genel Bakış</p>
                    <h1>Genel Bakış</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="admin-badge">
                    <span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
                    <span>Yönetici</span>
                </div>
            </header>

            <section class="welcome" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
                <h2 id="welcome-title">Yönetim paneline hoş geldiniz</h2>
                <p>Uygulamanızdaki kullanıcıları ve istek kayıtlarını buradan yönetebilirsiniz.</p>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="actions-title">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <h2 id="actions-title">Hızlı işlemler</h2>
                    <p>Yönetim araçlarına kolayca ulaşın.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cards">
                    <a class="card" href="/admin/listuser">
                        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">♙</span>
                        <h3>Kullanıcıları görüntüle</h3>
                        <p>Kayıtlı kullanıcıların listesini açın.</p>
                        <span class="card-action">Kullanıcı listesine git <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                    </a>

                    <a class="card" href="/admin/adduser">
                        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
                        <h3>Kullanıcı işlemleri</h3>
                        <p>Kullanıcı ekleme sayfasına gidin.</p>
                        <span class="card-action">İşleme git <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                    </a>

                    <a class="card" href="/admin/getlog">
                        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span>
                        <h3>İstek kayıtları</h3>
                        <p>Uygulamaya gelen isteklerin kayıtlarını inceleyin.</p>
                        <span class="card-action">Kayıtları görüntüle <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                    </a>

                    <a class="card" href="/admin/getuser">
                        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
                        <h3>Kullanıcı detayları</h3>
                        <p>Örnek kullanıcı detayları sayfasını açın.</p>
                        <span class="card-action">Detaylara git <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <footer class="footer-note">Yönetim Paneli</footer>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>